            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>One embodiment of the present invention provides a tire testing device provided with: a road surface unit including a road surface; and a carriage which rotatably holds a test wheel provided with a test tire, and which is capable of travelling along the road surface with the test wheel grounded on the road surface.</p>
